<div style="font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;color:#0f172a">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.3rem">🌙 Evening review — <%= @date.strftime("%A, %d %B") %></h1>

  <% if @ai_intro.present? %>
    <p style="background:#f0fdf4;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;color:#1f2a44"><%= @ai_intro %></p>
  <% end %>

  <% if @plan %>
    <% pct = @log.completion_percent %>
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem">
      You completed <strong><%= @log.blocks_done %> of <%= @log.blocks_total %></strong>
      study blocks today — <strong style="color:<%= pct >= 60 ? '#16a34a' : '#ea580c' %>"><%= pct %>%</strong>.
    </p>
    <div style="height:12px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0">
      <div style="height:100%;width:<%= pct %>%;background:<%= pct >= 60 ? '#16a34a' : '#ea580c' %>"></div>
    </div>
    <p style="color:#64748b">Current streak: <strong><%= @streak %></strong> day(s) at 60%+ completion.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>No plan was generated for today. Open the planner to set up your day.</p>
  <% end %>

  <p style="font-size:14px;margin-top:20px">
    Before bed, log your health check-ins (walk / water / sleep) and a quick note on what to fix tomorrow.
  </p>
  <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px">Protect your sleep. Tomorrow is another block. 🌙</p>
</div>
